title: Research1
---
“RA David Briar - Research Journal, Project DB - 02/2190”
“Day 1: We have just completed our first day of research on Project DB. Initial trials appear promising.”
“Day 12: We’ve just stabilized the virus. It now affects the infected’s respiratory system and skin cells.”
“Day 19: Animal trials have commenced. Areas of focus include strengthening the effect on cognitive deterioration.”
<<end_dialogue_fixed>>
===



