title: Research2
---
“Day 24: Doctor Nables has advised the council to speed up processes and shed some minor safety procedures in the interest of efficiency. No problems have arisen thus far.”
“Day 31: Almost 30 days ahead of schedule, Doctor Nables has demanded that we begin human trials at once. Two members of the council have now resigned from the project, but are unable to leave until the next shuttle, scheduled to depart in over a month.”
<<end_dialogue_fixed>>
===




title: FindDog1
---
<<start_dialogue_fixed>>
There's a little dog in kennel. It squeals and yips excitedly as you approach it.
The lone survivor in a base full of monsters...
You read a tag on it's collar. It has the name Skits.
<<end_dialogue_fixed>>
===

